:"./.collab/tasks/001/impl.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":62,"content":"- `scripts/check-traceability.mjs`：导出 `validateIndex`、`mergeShards`、`extractTitles`；CLI 支持 `--root`、`--index`、`--task-graph`、`--json`；脚本内无 `.collab` 字面量（任务图只经参数传入）。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":98,"content":"2. 抽查任务图 `.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json`（在本工作树内）：顶层确有 `acceptance[].levels`、`tasks[].acceptance`、`tasks[].milestone`；T-001 的 acceptance 为 AC-001/002/003/004/074，T-003 为 AC-006/007/008/072，T-004 含 AC-073，T-029 为 AC-038/069 且 milestone 为 M5；抽查的 AC-008/012/038/053/066/073 的 levels 与索引一致。所以 `check-traceability --task-graph` 不会误报 `graph.mismatch`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":102,"content":"6. `scripts/`、`test/helpers/platform-gate.mjs`、`test/unit/*.test.mjs` 中不含 `.collab` 字面量（A4-08 期望 0）。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":112,"content":"node scripts/check-traceability.mjs --task-graph .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json  # 期望 0","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/tasks/001/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":35,"content":"规格来源：`brief.md`，以及蓝图 `.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/` 下的 `design.md`（§3、§5、§6）、`interfaces.md`（§15）、`task-graph.json`（T-001）。本文只补充实现所需的、蓝图没有写死的细节。本文中由本设计新定的名字（错误标识、选项名、环境变量名、`ci-matrix.json` 的字段）都标明「本设计定义」，实现者不得改名，验收按这些名字判定。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":39,"content":"- 候选 #1（gpt-6.1-sol）在 stall 时只读了蓝图，没有产出 design.md 或 acceptance.md。工作区没有已跟踪文件的改动，没有代码文件，未跟踪项只有调度器的产物（`.collab/tasks/001/` 下的 logs、handoff、state.json、run.json、live.json）。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":46,"content":"- `.gitignore` 只忽略 `config/cliworker.local.json`、`usage.jsonl`、`node_modules/`、`.collab/worktrees/`，而且不在 write_scope 内，**不能改**。因此运行器的产物（files-executed.json、skips.jsonl）默认不能写进仓库目录，见 §3.4。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":255,"content":"- `--task-graph`：可选交叉校验，传入蓝图 `task-graph.json` 的路径。脚本里**不得出现字面量 `.collab`**（后续的 `check-no-collab` 会扫 `scripts/`），路径只能来自参数。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/tasks/001/acceptance.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":3,"content":"规格来源：`design.md`（本目录）与 brief。brief 没有给基准 commit 或既有验收报告，所以写域检查以 `HEAD` 为基准；蓝图任务图为 `.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":5,"content":"执行环境：仓库根（`C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\001`），PowerShell 7（`pwsh`），Node 20 或更高。所有命令在同一个 pwsh 会话里依次执行，先执行 §0 的辅助函数。「期望」一栏写的是命令的输出或退出码，任一条不符即该条不通过。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":22,"content":"git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all | ForEach-Object { $_.Substring(3) -replace ' -> .*','' } | Where-Object { $_ -notmatch '^\\.collab/tasks/001/' } | Where-Object { $p = $_; -not ($allowed | Where-Object { $p -match $_ }) }","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":25,"content":"期望：无任何输出（`.collab/tasks/001/` 下是调度器产物，不计）。跑过 `npm test` 之后仓库里也不应多出 `test-results/` 之类的文件，同一命令再执行一次仍无输出。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":47,"content":"git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all | ForEach-Object { $_.Substring(3) } | Where-Object { $_ -match '\\.(mjs|json|ps1|yml|md)$' -and $_ -notmatch '^\\.collab/' -and (Test-Path $_ -PathType Leaf) } | Where-Object { $b = [IO.File]::ReadAllBytes($_); ($b.Length -ge 3 -and $b[0] -eq 0xEF -and $b[1] -eq 0xBB -and $b[2] -eq 0xBF) -or ([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString($b) -match \"`r\") }","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":320,"content":"$r = Run scripts/check-traceability.mjs --task-graph .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json; $r.Exit; $r.Out -match 'graph\\.mismatch'","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":380,"content":"### A4-08 脚本不引用 `.collab`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":383,"content":"Select-String -Path scripts/*.m