pec/*.json、contracts/golden/** 均被 git 跟踪（git ls-files 列出）并通过各自 schema 校验；contracts/spec/** 与 contracts/golden/** 由 contracts/golden/manifest.json 逐文件登记 sha256，check-golden-frozen 在任一文件增删改时失败，且该检查已纳入 check-fast；check-write-scope 报出登记清单之外的 golden/spec 文件，以及落在任务 write_scope 之外的变更。例外：contracts/registry.snapshot.json 不做哈希冻结，只做 snapshot_version 递增 + compareRegistry 语义比较，v0.1 副本仅作回归夹具；该例外优先于任何字面冻结要求。check-no-collab 对 lib、scripts、test、contracts、docs、package.json 报告 0 处 .collab 引用，对 test/fixtures/no-collab 下的违规样例报出；gen-contract-doc 重新生成的 docs/contract.md 与已提交版本逐字节一致；registry.snapshot.json 含 interfaces 第 5 节的全部码、触发、阈值、原因、映射与 semantic_change。\r [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/tasks/003/brief.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":43,"content":"- 规格以 .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md、interfaces.md、task-graph.json 为准。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/tasks/002/brief.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":36,"content":"- 规格以 .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md、interfaces.md、task-graph.json 为准。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/tasks/001/brief.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":47,"content":"- 规格以 .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md、interfaces.md、task-graph.json 为准。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":115,"content":"      \"text\": \"git check-ignore -v 命中 config/a.local.json、state/x、a.jsonl、.collab/x，不命中 config/cliworker.example.json。加载带 _example:true 的配置返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE、退出码 3；加载重新缩进过的 example 副本（无该标记）同样返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE。init 遇到已存在的目标文件时返回 E_CONFIG_EXISTS，且文件不变。\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":199,"content":"      \"text\": \"check-pack 解析 npm pack --dry-run --json：包含 bin/cliworker.mjs、config/cliworker.example.json、lib 下文件、contracts/registry.snapshot.json、contracts/schemas、contracts/host、contracts/context、contracts/agentline-forbidden.json；package.json 的 bin.cliworker 为 bin/cliworker.mjs；不含 config/*.local.json、state/、*.jsonl、test/、scripts/、.collab/、contracts/golden、contracts/spec；dsh.plugin.json 的 version 与 package.json 一致。defects/a2-pack 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":483,"content":"      \"text\": \"npm pack 后安装到临时目录：cliworker --version 成功；cliworker doctor --config <临时配置> 成功；import 包入口，用宿主 stub 注册后 getRegistration().status 为 ok；安装目录中不存在 contracts/golden、contracts/spec、.collab。\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":540,"content":"      \"text\": \"权威规格自包含且可判据（F-02 加强）：contracts/registry.snapshot.json、contracts/spec/*.json、contracts/golden/** 均被 git 跟踪（git ls-files 列出）并通过各自 schema 校验；contracts/spec/** 与 contracts/golden/** 由 contracts/golden/manifest.json 逐文件登记 sha256，check-golden-frozen 在任一文件增删改时失败，且该检查已纳入 check-fast；check-write-scope 报出登记清单之外的 golden/spec 文件，以及落在任务 write_scope 之外的变更。例外：contracts/registry.snapshot.json 不做哈希冻结，只做 snapshot_version 递增 + compareRegistry 语义比较，v0.1 副本仅作回归夹具；该例外优先于任何字面冻结要求。check-no-collab 对 lib、scripts、test、contracts、docs、package.json 报告 0 处 .collab 引用，对 test/fixtures/no-collab 下的违规样例报出；gen-contract-doc 重新生成的 docs/contract.md 与已提交版本逐字节一致；registry.snapshot.json 含 interfaces 第 5 节的全部码、触发、阈值、原因、映射与 semantic_change。\",\r [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":751,"content":"      \"title\": \"契约冻结：自包含注册表、仓库内规格与金标、示例、校验器、视图扫描器、禁止引用 .collab\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":815,"content":"      \"title\": \"路径统一与配置健壮性：resolvePaths、state_dir、.gitignore（含 .collab/）、示例识别、null 配置（A4）\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/review-v2.verdict.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":30,"content":"      \"text\": \"确认 TB-6：冻结注册表的权威 oracle 仍只存在于 .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/（interfaces.md【1】..【15】节、designer.log/state.json 的 B.4.4 金标、review-v1.verdict.json、task-graph.json）。已核实这些文件确在该目录，但 .gitignore 无 .collab/ 规则、package.json 的 files 白名单为 [lib,cordis.patch.yml,dsh.plugin.json,README.md] 不含 .collab/，且 AC-025 明确要求 npm pack 不含 .collab/——即权威规格既不随包发布、也未声明为版本化随仓库提交的机读产物。T-004 输入是『interfaces 第 1～15 节』，AC-016 标 B.4.4，AC-010/AC-015 唯一预期值与 AC-067 的 semantic_change 清单都从这些节推导；干净 CI checkout 无此目录时，冻结/比较/金标/迁移文档测试缺稳定真源。contracts/registry.snapshot.json 只登记码与枚举，并非公式、阈值表、B.4.4 金标与 draft→v1 映射的真源。须在 M1 前把权威规格提升为 contracts/ 下版本化、提交、机读的 artifacts（并入 T-004 输出的 docs/contract.md），令 registry.snapshot.json 自包含、运行时不读 .collab/，并明确 AC-015/016/017/051 各金标对应哪个仓库内文件。\"\r [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/interfaces.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":1,"content":"【1 ModelRequest v1】CLI：cliworker models select --request-file <f>，或 --level Top --count 2 --usage Heavy --importance high --cwd <p> --request-id r-001；HTTP：POST /cliworker/select。{schema:'cliworker.request/v1', request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', count:2, usage:'Heavy', importance:'normal', require_readonly:true, cwd:'C:/work/repo', timeout_ms:1800000, exclude_handles:['h_1a2b']}。规则：level 必填，取 Top/High/Middle/Quick，大小写不敏感，缺失返回 E_LEVEL_REQUIRED，非法返回 E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN；count 取 1..10，默认 1；usage 取 Heavy/Normal/Light，默认 Normal；importance 取 normal/high，默认 normal，其他值返回 E_REQUEST_INVALID；未知字段给 W_FIELD_IGNORED:{field}；tier 是 level 的别名，给 W_FIELD_DEPRECATED。draft 视图：不带 schema 或带 compat:'draft' 时得到 draft 视图并带 W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED，0.3.0 移除；CLI 允许 draft，HTTP 上 draft 与 view:'full' 都需要有效会话，否则返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；CLI 的 models select 带 view:'full' 返回 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN，完整视图只在 admin select。【2 ModelSelection v1（AgentLine 视图）】成功：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:true, request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', usage:'He [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":19,"content":"   - `docs/contract.md` 由脚本从规格生成。`check-no-collab` 禁止仓库里任何代码、测试、文档引用 `.collab`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":53,"content":"| F-02 | 规格与金标入库，snapshot 自包含，禁止引用 `.collab` | T-004、AC-073；AC-015/016/017/051 改为读 `contracts/golden` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":65,"content":"2. `.gitignore` 只有 3 条字面规则。本轮改为 `config/*.local.json`、`state/`、`*.jsonl`、`.collab/`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":119,"content":"- `scripts/check-no-collab.mjs` 扫描 `lib`、`scripts`、`test`、`contracts`、`docs`、`package.json`，出现 `.collab` 即失败。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":86,"totalMatchedLines":86,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-fb9aca31-c51a-44ec-b00c-ce5b223651f7-20\nfc_b57b6001-93e7-97b9-b697-27fa87519bd8_0","startedAtMs":"1794061317899","completedAtMs":"1794061318515"},"model_call_id":"55d2d473-447d-4acc-93b1-e83c9432ad95-4-hv50","session_id":"4cef3f0d-03ba-4417-bf0e-ce33fbb35a9e","timestamp_ms":1794061319381}
